<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 112 0 R/E(What a spectacular showing of community spirit! On Saturday, May 16, 2026, neighbors rolled up their sleeves for the Calabazas Creek Cleanup. We had 34 volunteers and collected over 500 pounds of garbage! A massive THANK YOU to every volunteer who donated their morning and energy, making our local waterways safer and more beautiful.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[8]>>
