endobj

155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 113 0 R/E(Our village is full of incredible talent, but it also means we occasionally have to say bittersweet goodbyes. We want to extend a massive, heartfelt congratulations to our wonderful newsletter layout editor, Amina, who will be heading off to college starting this summer. Amina has been instrumental in keeping our community informed and connected, and while we will miss her creative eye around the neighborhood, we are incredibly proud of her next chapter. Thank you, Amina, for all your hard work!)/Pg 11 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 113 0 R/E(With Amina stepping into her college adventure, we are officially searching for our next volunteer Newsletter Layout Editor.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[2]>>
