165 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 113 0 R/E(Mark your calendars\204our highly anticipated Dumpster Day is officially set for Saturday, July 18, 2026! This is your perfect chance to clear out the clutter, help keep our streets beautiful, and connect with fellow neighbors. We will be setting up dumpsters at multiple locations across the village for a busy day of community cleanup, and we need your energy to make it run smoothly.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

166 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 113 0 R/E(An event this big takes a true village effort, and we are looking for enthusiastic volunteers to pitch in! Whether you can help host a dumpster site, manage drop-offs to the Goodwill trucks, make sandwiches to keep our crew fueled, or assist our site monitors, there is a role for everyone. No experience is necessary\204just a love for our community and a desire to help out.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

